Comment: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnFansub Block\bord0\shad0\fscx900\fscy1200\c&HE0E9E9&\pos(310,442)}A
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you laughing in your sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was I laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You seemed incredibly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Must've been a great dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.43,0:02:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.34,0:02:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A long time ago, I{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was a very, very happy dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.99,0:02:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was about the place you want to go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:03:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are we cleaning up today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's such a pant having to deal with all of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry! I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. We've got to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Move on, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once you've got it all tied up, can you put it in the hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.32,0:04:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After this, why don't we take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of tough without Fujimoto around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He must be busy at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't overwork yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I want to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to work so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to fire me, why don't you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For deciding to close the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's only thing I'd like you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've come to terms with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not because Okiura told me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:05:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I made the decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you mind coming to the nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's still a few things of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Throw it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm busy. I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'll be about an hour late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.48,0:08:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you said you were going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got done early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you look so worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're gonna ruin my mood, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you worrying about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It hurts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka said she was fine with Yomogi Nursery closing down, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even still...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this about Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, what about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you realize you're{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man. Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have work today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But today's the day they're tearing down the{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.21,0:10:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He could have at least taken the day off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.03,0:10:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If he's gone, I'm leaving too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.98,0:10:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I'll be back later tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to hurry up, or you'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.40,0:11:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have everything out of there, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We were able to move everything yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's that guy that's always glaring at people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He had to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.48,0:11:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, no grace at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He spent so much time here, too. That's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Okiura told me to take care of you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because he won't be around for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like he's having trouble higher up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.35,0:12:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goons like me don't really get to know about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then Okiura's{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, he's Okiura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.81,0:12:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.43,0:12:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So we came to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I asked mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.64,0:12:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, boss, can we get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we start, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.06,0:13:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous. Let's stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.02,0:13:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll tell you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point talking with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean, Genko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Going on break before me. Mmmmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zuisho!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!? You're going to try and catch a Bunny!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. With a Bunny hostage, he'll have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really think God will fall for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's better than doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With how we are now, it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.76,0:14:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ginsei's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, He's being a lot more straightforward than you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Simple or no, we can fix that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you learn anything last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to catch his attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know who's gonna take the brunt of it, right? If you don't, I'll be glad to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.35,0:15:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe what God was trying to teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is how to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I sure am bad at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, fine. I won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am Iorogi. I will accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once we're done, the lot will be off limits, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seemed so big from inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.74,0:16:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But looking at it like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.98,0:16:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.12,0:17:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to be there for Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think Yomogi was holding him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Holding him back? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's why he's always working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I relied on him too much, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I had realized sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:47.50,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:51.52,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Mister Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.76,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,Play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should tell him to do what he likes for his own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he's really enthusiastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. That's exactly why you need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because he always tries too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So please take care of him, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.23,0:18:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Terrible news, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto... You...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like I promised, I didn't contact anyone from Yomogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I only talked to Chitose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kobato. He said he didn't want to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it like him to be worried about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Your arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you weren't hurt too badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.95,0:20:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try not to overdo it, okay? Everyone's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be inconvenient only being able to use one hand. If there's anything I can do, just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.93,0:20:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you when we first met.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:28.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just doing this out of pity or self-sacrifice, stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.61,0:20:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're just going to feel sorry for me, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that, Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.16,0:20:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's telling you you have until the next full moon to gather candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't, you know what the agreement is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.06,0:21:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can I extend that deadline?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going to happen now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:04.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno. It's all up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He really seems like he feels guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If not for that fight, she would have...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If he had taken that blow, it wouldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.83,0:22:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If there's anything I can do, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.37,0:22:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just give her four more seasons!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.76,0:22:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, just one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.57,0:22:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there anything!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.44,0:22:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.14,0:00:47.02,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.02,0:00:55.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.32,0:01:05.12,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.62,0:01:10.92,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.92,0:01:18.68,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.68,0:01:24.35,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.35,0:01:29.56,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.56,0:01:35.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.86,0:01:41.53,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.53,0:01:48.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.25,0:01:56.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.64,0:02:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Day of Farewells
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.11,0:24:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an1\fs22\shad0\fad(500,0)\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(105,384)}Next episode: "... Kobato's Wish"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.19,0:23:05.19,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,In between the things I've lost
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:11.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,and the things I've been able to hold on to,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:20.04,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Your smile falls in that gap
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.62,0:23:26.13,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like I can reach it, but I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.30,0:23:31.55,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:38.06,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just wanted to make you smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:43.52,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My two wings weren't good enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.81,0:23:48.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I even have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:55.49,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just smiling by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:24:00.33,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,is all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.87,0:24:07.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Just warming you is good enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.46,0:24:11.93,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,even though I want to embrace you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:19.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even with these scarred, worthless wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.18,0:24:27.78,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,right now I can smile
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF0F0F0&\bord0\an7\fs36\fnBaar Sophia\pos(455,49)}Closing Notice\N{\fs30}We regret to announce\Nthe closing of this\Nnursery.\NAny further questions\N should be directed\Nto the headmistress,\NOkiura Sayaka.
